## Model card

- **Name:** Gemini 4 Argon (High)
- **Short description:** Google's advanced reasoning model, strong across intelligence benchmarks with excellent cost-effectiveness and multimodal capabilities.
- **Provider / access:** Google Gemini API (`gemini-4-argon`), Vertex AI. Chat Completions API.
- **Release / knowledge:** September 30, 2026 release. Knowledge cutoff varies by workload.
- **IDs:** `gemini-4-argon` (Gemini API), `google/gemini-4-argon` (Vertex AI)
- **Context window:** 1M tokens (≈1500 A4 pages). Verified via Artificial Analysis.
- **Modalities:** Text and image input; text output. Reasoning (chain-of-thought) enabled. Tool calling supported. JSON mode available.
- **Pricing (as of 2026-10):** $2.00/M input tokens, $10.00/M output tokens. Cache reads: 95% discount. Cache writes: not disclosed (assume ~$5/M). Fast mode: not disclosed. Cache discount of 95% on typical workloads. Free tiers may be available via Google Cloud Vertex AI.
- **Architecture:** Proprietary. No parameter count disclosed. Uses extended thinking/reasoning (high tier).

